  storyText: "NCPD Interrogation\n\nAn NCPD officer scans your ID with a bored face. \"Dead netrunner, chromed-up gangers, and you. Funny. Anything to declare?\"\n\nThe shard is in your boot. He hasn't found it. Yet.\n\n1. Lie: \"I saw nothing.\"\n2. Tell the truth and hand it over.\n3. Offer him your eb."
